<title>USA: Thermo Optek files for shr offer.</title>
<headline>Thermo Optek files for shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Optek Corp said on Tuesday that it has filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission to register up to 400,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Thermo said the common stock is to be issued in connection with its proposed acquisition of Laser Science Inc for $3.4 million in Thermo Optek stock.</p>
<p>Laser Science makes pulsed nitrogen, dye, and pulsed carbon dioxide lasers.</p>
<p>Thermo Optek Corp makes instruments for quantitative and qualitative chemical analysis.</p>
